# ═══ Draft knowledge entry — CMake 上游头文件装到 include/<subdir> 导致 test_package 找不到头文件 ═══
# Timestamp: 2026-08-07
# Software: airspyhf 1.6.8
# Gate: conan-verify G2 (test_package)
# Status: UNMATCHED — needs human/AI review to promote to E-entry
#
# To promote:
#   1. Review the error excerpt below
#   2. Rename to E0XX.kv and move to knowledge/graph/
#   3. Add a row to knowledge/graph/index.tsv

id: DRAFT-airspyhf-cmake-header-subdir
severity: 2
category: cmake|conan-recipe|header-path
trigger_tool: conan|cmake
phase: conan-verify (test_package build)
approach: 检查上游 install(TARGETS/FILES ... DESTINATION) 真实头文件目录，package_info() 的
  cpp_info.includedirs 必须指向 include/<subdir> 而非 include/，并确认上游源码 #include 形式一致

keywords: fatal error, file not found, airspyhf.h, includedirs, test_package, install, PROJECT_NAME,
  include/, include/libairspyhf

error_signature: fatal error: '.+\.h' file not found|test_package.*\.c:\d+:\d+: fatal error
match_keywords: file not found, includedirs, test_package, header, CMakeLists install

root_cause: 上游 CMake 用 install(FILES ${c_headers} DESTINATION include/${PROJECT_NAME}) 把头文件
  装进 include/<subdir>，但 conan-init 生成的模板配方 package_info() 默认 includedirs=["include"]，
  test_package 的 #include <xxx.h> 找不到头文件，G2 在 test_package 阶段失败。
  知识图谱仅匹配到 E001（找不到编译器），根因完全不同，属误匹配。
affected_scope: 所有 CMake 工程头文件安装到 include/<subdir>（如 include/libairspyhf、include/libusb-1.0）
  且 test_package 以顶层 <subdir>/../ 形式 include 的场景

rec_priority: 1
rec_approach: 先读上游 CMakeLists 确认 install(FILES ... DESTINATION) 目标目录，再把
  package_info() 的 cpp_info.includedirs 指向实际子目录（如 ["include/libairspyhf"]），
  与上游工具源码的 #include <airspyhf.h> 保持一致
rec_description: 修正 package_info includedirs 指向实际头文件子目录后重跑 conan-verify
rec_command: grep -rn "DESTINATION include" <src>/CMakeLists.txt && 修改 conanfile.py package_info() includedirs
rec_auto_fix: false
rec_impl: recipe-package-info

doc_file:

principles: P-CMAKE-001

# ── Error excerpt (relevant lines) ──
error_text_excerpt: |
  /storage/.../test_package/test.c:5:10: fatal error: 'airspyhf.h' file not found
  #include <airspyhf.h>
           ^~~~~~~~~~~~
  1 error generated.
  ERROR: airspyhf/1.6.8@ohpcd/stable (test package): Error in build() method
  -- Installing: .../include/libairspyhf/airspyhf.h
  -- Installing: .../include/libairspyhf/iqbalancer.h
  -- Installing: .../include/libairspyhf/airspyhf_commands.h
